/* 控件与副本/速查两页同一套（小程序页面样式各自隔离，只能各写一份定义）；
   颜色一律走 app.wxss 的令牌，这里不许出现裸色值。 */

.lead {
  padding: 22rpx 24rpx;
  margin-bottom: 18rpx;
}

.lead-t {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--txt-title);
}

.lead-s {
  margin-top: 8rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: var(--txt-muted);
}

.cgrid {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.ccard {
  width: 48.5%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background: var(--panel);
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  padding: 16rpx;
  margin-bottom: 16rpx;
}

.ccard:nth-child(odd) {
  margin-right: 3%;
}

.crow {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}

.crow2 {
  margin-top: 12rpx;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.crow2 .badge {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-left: 8rpx;
}

.cmain {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  margin-left: 12rpx;
}

.cname {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: var(--txt-title);
}

.cen {
  margin-top: 2rpx;
  font-size: 20rpx;
  color: var(--txt-hint);
}

.csub {
  font-size: 21rpx;
  color: var(--txt-muted);
}

.search {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 14rpx;
}

.search-input {
  flex: 1;
  background: var(--panel-2);
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  padding: 14rpx 20rpx;
  color: var(--txt);
  font-size: 26rpx;
}

.fav-btn {
  margin-left: 14rpx;
  padding: 12rpx 18rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--txt-dim);
}

.chips {
  white-space: nowrap;
  margin-bottom: 14rpx;
}

.colnote {
  margin: 2rpx 0 16rpx;
  font-size: 21rpx;
  line-height: 1.55;
}

.grp {
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
}

.grp-h {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 10rpx 16rpx;
  margin-bottom: 8rpx;
  background: var(--panel-2);
  border-left: 4rpx solid var(--gold);
  font-size: 25rpx;
  color: var(--gold-hi);
}

.grp-n {
  margin-left: auto;
  font-size: 21rpx;
  color: var(--txt-hint);
}

.sp {
  background: var(--panel);
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  margin-bottom: 10rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.sp-open {
  border-color: var(--gold-line);
}

.sp-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 14rpx 16rpx;
}

.sp-main {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  margin-left: 14rpx;
}

.sp-name {
  font-size: 27rpx;
  color: var(--txt);
}

.sp-rel {
  margin-left: 10rpx;
  padding: 2rpx 8rpx;
  border: 1rpx dashed var(--line-2);
  border-radius: 6rpx;
  font-size: 19rpx;
  color: var(--txt-hint);
}

.sp-meta {
  margin-top: 2rpx;
  font-size: 21rpx;
}

.sp-side {
  text-align: right;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-left: 10rpx;
}

.sp-src {
  margin-top: 4rpx;
  font-size: 19rpx;
}

.chip-st {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 3rpx 10rpx;
  border-radius: 6rpx;
  font-size: 20rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line-2);
  color: var(--txt-dim);
}

.st-new {
  color: var(--gold-hot);
  border-color: var(--gold);
}

.st-changed,
.st-renamed {
  color: var(--txt-caution);
  border-color: var(--warn);
}

.st-removed {
  color: var(--txt-alert);
  border-color: var(--bad);
}

.st-same {
  color: var(--txt-dim);
}

.sp-detail {
  padding: 14rpx 16rpx 16rpx;
  border-top: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  background: var(--panel-2);
}

.detail-actions {
  margin-bottom: 12rpx;
}

.detail-actions .btn {
  background: transparent;
}

.altline {
  padding: 10rpx 14rpx;
  margin-bottom: 12rpx;
  border-left: 4rpx solid var(--warn);
  background: var(--warn-bg);
  font-size: 21rpx;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: var(--txt-caution);
}

.lvlbox {
  margin-bottom: 12rpx;
}

.lvl-h {
  font-size: 21rpx;
  color: var(--txt-dim);
  margin-bottom: 6rpx;
}

.lvl {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  padding: 6rpx 0;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  font-size: 22rpx;
}

.lvl:last-child {
  border-bottom: 0;
}

.lvl-i {
  width: 110rpx;
  color: var(--txt-dim);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.lvl-v {
  flex: 1;
  color: var(--txt);
}

.lvl-id {
  font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  font-size: 19rpx;
}

.prov {
  background: var(--sunk);
  border-radius: 10rpx;
  padding: 12rpx 14rpx;
  margin-bottom: 8rpx;
}

.prov-type {
  font-size: 21rpx;
  color: var(--ok);
}

.prov-at {
  margin-left: 12rpx;
  font-size: 19rpx;
}

.prov-url {
  word-break: break-all;
  font-size: 20rpx;
  margin-top: 2rpx;
}

.truncated,
.build {
  margin: 12rpx 0;
  font-size: 21rpx;
}
